<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal Bank unit in jv with Korean firm.</title>
<headline>Rizal Bank unit in jv with Korean firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp said on Friday its unit, RCBC Capital Corp, and Korean Investment Trust Co Ltd had signed a memorandum of agreement to forge a joint venture.</p>
<p>They plan to set up an investment house with RCBC Capital taking a 60 percent equity stake and Korean Investment the remaining 40 percent.</p>
<p>The bank said the proposed shareholders' agreement is now under review by both firms.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
